sequenceDiagram
    participant Flow as Flow / Activity
    participant Queue as System-Queue
    participant Agent as Pega Agent
    participant Act as Agent Activity
    participant DB as Database

    Flow->>Queue: Queue-For-Agent (item)
    Note over Agent: Runs on schedule per node
    Agent->>Queue: Poll queue items
    Queue-->>Agent: Next item
    Agent->>Act: Execute activity
    Act->>DB: Process (Obj-Save, etc.)
    DB-->>Act: Confirm
    Act-->>Agent: Complete
    Agent->>Queue: Remove / mark done
